hip label read from the first entity to the second.&lt;br&gt;Many-to-many kept as relationships here (acknowledges, capital share, offtake price); decomposed in the Logical ERD.&lt;br&gt;Technical tables (idempotency requests, price checks, event details) appear only from the Logical level." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1320" width="330" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>